    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the beginning</h2>.A cute cat is trying to make a cream soda!<br>Work together with the cat to add more and more decorations!<br>Stick the decorations dropped on the soda and make vanilla ice cream to create the perfect cream soda!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>.This game is a 2D puzzle game with a new sensation of floating objects.<br><br>This game is for solo play.<br><br>During the game, you can drop decorations into the soda. If you bump the same decoration against each other, it will change to the next decoration. Each time a decoration changes, your score will increase, so aim for a high score!<br>... However, be careful not to drop the decoration from the cup, because your record will end there!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the beginning</h2>.A cute cat is trying to make a cream soda!<br>Work together with the cat to add more and more decorations!<br>Stick the decorations dropped on the soda and make vanilla ice cream to create the perfect cream soda!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>.This game is a 2D puzzle game with a new sensation of floating objects.<br><br>This game is for solo play.<br><br>During the game, you can drop decorations into the soda. If you bump the same decoration against each other, it will change to the next decoration. Each time a decoration changes, your score will increase, so aim for a high score!<br>... However, be careful not to drop the decoration from the cup, because your record will end there!",
    "short_description": "Let's make a cream soda with the help of a cute cat! This is a 2D puzzle game! Don't get carried away with the decorations and don't drop them!",
